</head>
<body>
  <div class="nav__container">
    <section class="menu__links__section" id="menu__links__section">
      <button class="close__btn" id="close__btn">
        <img src="/icons/close.svg" alt="Close"/>
      </button>

      <a href="/">&bull; Home </a>
      <a href="/ideas">&bull; Ideas&nbsp;/Inspirations </a>
      <a href="/tips">&bull; Tips and Tricks </a>
      <a href="/updates">&bull; Updates </a>
      <a href="/faq">&bull; FAQ </a>
    </section>
    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="nav__divs nav__div1">
        <button id="menu__btn" class="menu__btn">
          <img src="/icons/menu.svg" alt="Menu" />
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="nav__divs nav__div2">
        <a href="/"> SweetDreams AI </a>
      </div>

      <div class="nav__divs nav__div3">
        <a href="/donate">
          <img src="./icons/donate.svg" alt="Donate" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <!-- THEME LOGIC -->
      <div class="theme__choice__container">
          <button id="theme__choice" class="theme__choice">
                  <img id="light__theme" style="display: none;" width="40px" height="auto" src="/icons/sun.svg" alt="☀️" />
                  <img id="dark__theme" width="40px" height="auto" src="/icons/moon.svg" alt="🌙" />
          </button>
      </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Master the Art of Storytelling</h1>
            <p>Learn how to create the most magical and engaging bedtime stories with these pro tips</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tips-grid">
            <div class="tip-card">
                <h3>&bull; Be Specific & Detailed</h3>
                <p>Instead of generic characters, give them personality traits, hobbies, or quirks.</p>
                <div class="example">
                    <strong>Instead of:</strong> "a dragon"<br>
                    <strong>Try:</strong> "a tiny dragon who collects shiny rocks and sneezes glitter"
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-card">
                <h3>&bull; Add Magical Elements</h3>
                <p>Incorporate fantasy elements that spark imagination and wonder.</p>
                <div class="example">
                    <strong>Examples:</strong> talking animals, enchanted forests, floating islands, whispering trees, starlight rivers
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-card">
                <h3>&bull; Engage All Senses</h3>
                <p>Describe not just what characters see, but what they hear, smell, and feel.</p>
                <div class="example">
                    "The cave smelled of damp earth and ancient secrets, with crystals that hummed a gentle lullaby"
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-card">
                <h3>&bull; Create Gentle Conflict</h3>
                <p>Add mild challenges that are easily resolved for satisfying endings.</p>
                <div class="example">
                    <strong>Instead of:</strong> "a scary monster"<br>
                    <strong>Try:</strong> "a lost path, a missing object, a misunderstood character, or a simple puzzle"
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-card">
                <h3>&bull; Use Our Prompt Ideas</h3>
                <p>Don't forget! We've built-in prompt suggestions in the main story generator.</p>
                <div class="example">
                    <strong>New in v6:</strong> Random story ideas automatically appear as placeholders. Can't think of anything? Just use what's already there!
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-card">
                <h3>&bull; Visit Story Ideas Page</h3>
                <p>Stuck for inspiration? We've curated an entire page of creative story starters.</p>
                <div class="example">
                    <strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Bookmark the Story Ideas page and mix concepts from different categories for truly unique tales!
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pro-section">
            <h2>&bull; Advanced Storytelling Secrets</h2>
            <div class="tips-grid">
                <div class="tip-card" style="background: #3a3a3a; border-left-color: #fff;">
                    <h3>&bull; Create Character Arcs</h3>
                    <p id="guide__para1">Even simple stories benefit from characters who learn or grow.</p>
                    <div class="example" style="background: #2c2c2c;">
                        <p>"A shy fox learns to speak up", "A impatient rabbit discovers the joy of waiting"</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="tip-card" style="background: #3a3a3a; border-left-color: #fff;">
                    <h3>&bull; Build to Peaceful Endings</h3>
                    <p id="guide__para2">Always conclude with calm, resolution, and sleep-ready vibes.</p>
                    <div class="example" style="background: #2c2c2c;">
                        <p>"And as the stars twinkled above, they all drifted into peaceful dreams..."</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

  <hr class="hr__footer">
  <footer class="footer">
    &copy;All Right Reserved. <br>
    SweetDreams AI  &bull;  <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>
  </footer>

</body>
<script defer src="/js/tips.js"></script>
</html>
